  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Designed for busy lives, this stylish home combines sea views, security and effortless coastal living in a peaceful gated community.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, sun-filled open-plan living and the balcony take in panoramic sea views - a fabulous space to unwind or entertain. A private courtyard at the back offers another sunny spot for coffee, drinks or relaxed weekends.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\n\r\n• Panoramic sea views\r\n• Open-plan kitchen, dining & living\r\n• 4 bedrooms | 3 bathrooms\r\n• Master with ensuite & walk-in wardrobe\r\n• Sunny private courtyard\r\n• Double garage, EV-ready + 1 off-street parking\r\n• 5kW solar power system\r\n• Secure, easy lock-up-and-leave living\r\n• Rangitoto College zone\r\n• Moments from Browns Bay Beach, cafés, restaurants & coastal walks\r\n\r\nCome home, switch off and enjoy the coast.",
